      "<p>Ready for laundry and mudroom storage that fits a Brooklyn apartment? Email <a href=\"mailto:orders@greencabinetsny.com\">orders@greencabinetsny.com</a> or call <a href=\"tel:+17188045488\">(718) 804-5488</a>. Include borough, photos of the wall or closet, washer/dryer model if known, and whether you want lockers, a bench, or just a stack enclosure. We reply with next steps for a by-appointment measure in Brooklyn, Manhattan, or Queens. Learn more <a href=\"/about\">about us</a> or browse the <a href=\"/blog\">blog</a>.</p>",
